    "description": "Auto-name tabs after where the work is and what is running there -- the directory, the branch, the machine reached over ssh, then the program or the task an agent reports -- and/or prefix workspaces, tabs, and agents with their 1-9 jump-key number. Each feature toggles via config.sh.",
